{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06345","headline":"渔父歌 · 李颀","name":"渔父歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白首何老人，蓑笠蔽其身。\n避世长不仕，钓鱼清江滨。\n浦沙明濯足，山月静垂纶。\n寓宿湍与濑，行歌秋复春。\n持竿湘岸竹，爇火芦洲薪。\n绿水饭香稻，青荷包紫鳞。\n於中还自乐，所欲全吾真。\n而笑独醒者，临流多苦辛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}